Nethack is the descendant of Rogue, from which Hack sprang, and then 
Nethack(now at version 3.1) The common theme is; you must find the Amulet of 
Yendor, which is found in the lower(and I DO mean lower :) ) levels of the 
Dungeon of Doom. It's "easier" on the upper dungeon levels, but gets 
progressively tougher(or easier if you're expert enuff ;) ). Ok, so ya got 
the amulet now..does the game end now?! NOOOO: you must go BACK up to level 1 
where you came from and go up. It's a bit tuffer now; when you up on nethack 
3.0+ you go into the endgame; pretty tuff level. 

Who knows what'll descend from Nethack?! :-P


P.S. I'm not counting Larn, Moria, Omega, etc., since the goals there are 
different. ;)

